# ==========================================
# HR MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - CLIENT CONFIG
# ==========================================

# 1. Local Development (default - uses Vite proxy):
# Leave empty or set to /api/v1 (vite.config.js proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:5000)
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1

# 2. Deployed on Vercel (Fullstack Monorepo - both frontend & backend on Vercel):
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty! Vercel rewrites /api/* to /api/index.js automatically.

# 3. Deployed on Vercel (Frontend only, Backend hosted on Render / Railway / Hostinger / VPS):
# Set this in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com/api/v1
# IMPORTANT: In Vite, env variables are compiled into the JavaScript bundle at BUILD time.
# After adding or changing VITE_API_URL in Vercel, you MUST trigger a "Redeploy" in Vercel Deployments.
